        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "9b3352a2-6df5-31bd-b6d9-e30ca7df76b3",
                "word": "lek",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e7d3e7f6-444e-4ff6-b765-aac3efc4e8e2",
                        "entry_id": "9b3352a2-6df5-31bd-b6d9-e30ca7df76b3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "leks"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "31d97fbd-1abf-398e-93cc-26a44d87aa5e",
                        "entry_id": "9b3352a2-6df5-31bd-b6d9-e30ca7df76b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Unité monétaire albanaise."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "071247b3-1728-433e-a22f-f81b8caf1b4c",
                                "sense_id": "31d97fbd-1abf-398e-93cc-26a44d87aa5e",
                                "text": "La question économique s’invite aussi dans le processus, le cours du lek ayant augmenté de 25 % entre 2016 et 2023."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3652a1fa-e629-4548-8907-f80704cd8f2b",
                                "sense_id": "31d97fbd-1abf-398e-93cc-26a44d87aa5e",
                                "text": "Par contre, les garder pour un temps à venir, cela paraissait risqué à cause de l’inflation du lek qui avait déjà atteint un taux très important."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d6fff021-204e-4370-86f1-40238bd17de8",
                        "source_entry_id": "9b3352a2-6df5-31bd-b6d9-e30ca7df76b3",
                        "source_sense_id": "31d97fbd-1abf-398e-93cc-26a44d87aa5e",
                        "target_lang_word": "lek",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lek",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f31fff8a-357b-3144-9b51-a0e551dfed09",
                                        "entry_id": "024bb1df-72cb-3371-88a6-2ddb28366cc8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An aggregation of male animals for the purposes of courtship and display."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60b7c0a9-65e0-48f1-b7fc-3d702cd58a0c",
                                                "sense_id": "f31fff8a-357b-3144-9b51-a0e551dfed09",
                                                "text": "1975, Edward O. Wilson, Sociobiology: The New Synthesis, figure caption, 2000, page 333,\nEach of the three displaying cocks occupies a small territory at the mating center of the lek."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc2c9576-0af1-423e-b783-fafda13a90e0",
                                                "sense_id": "f31fff8a-357b-3144-9b51-a0e551dfed09",
                                                "text": "Given that a combination of factors have \"released\" males from attending nests, why have some species organized their courtship bouts in leks, especially the tightly clumped leks that are typical of manakins and cocks-of-the-rock?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a479923-f044-4d3f-9cb9-046e592fb3b8",
                                                "sense_id": "f31fff8a-357b-3144-9b51-a0e551dfed09",
                                                "text": "Nevertheless, it does appear that many of the processes of mate choice and sexual selection described for bird and mammal leks also apply to anuran choruses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "lek",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a67b2bed-ee10-36e9-a9e9-24e0f04fa9c6",
                                        "entry_id": "eecbe8f2-ad9c-3910-8026-40e27a1aa0e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To take part in the courtship and display behaviour of a lek."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5f593d5-d524-44cf-8fa0-d964c1e533e6",
                                                "sense_id": "a67b2bed-ee10-36e9-a9e9-24e0f04fa9c6",
                                                "text": "Males in many lekking species have conspicuous morphological ornaments that may be targets of female choice, but male contest competition may also be involved."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25bd0627-0b2a-429c-a7e1-5b895866c273",
                                                "sense_id": "a67b2bed-ee10-36e9-a9e9-24e0f04fa9c6",
                                                "text": "The second reason lekking is so fascinating is because the males aggregate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6506a3b8-8863-407c-bf93-852339a5f80b",
                                                "sense_id": "a67b2bed-ee10-36e9-a9e9-24e0f04fa9c6",
                                                "text": "2010, Boaz Yuval, Jorge Hendrichs 17: Behavior of Fruit Fly in the Genus Ceratitis (Dacinae: Ceratitidini), Martin Aluja, Allen Norrbom (editors), Fruit Flies (Tephritidae): Phylogeny and Evolution of Behavior, page 437,\nIn a recent study (Yuval et al. 1998), the size and weight of males captured either lekking or resting at the same time in the vicinity of leks were measured."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "235ac6b2-fa6d-4548-ab99-34e8833aafd0",
                                                "sense_id": "a67b2bed-ee10-36e9-a9e9-24e0f04fa9c6",
                                                "text": "Half a dozen of the thumbnail-size males lekked in a sunny glade."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3951a70d-ed8d-3b49-ae7c-ef186b76b092",
                                        "entry_id": "eecbe8f2-ad9c-3910-8026-40e27a1aa0e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To play."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "Yorkshire",
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "dialectal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "949a3253-3e82-414e-8f1b-7bb1d63086ab",
                                                "sense_id": "3951a70d-ed8d-3b49-ae7c-ef186b76b092",
                                                "text": "T’lads is lekkin i t’park."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "lek",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16e14a75-0d7a-3122-931a-6b8db37ab514",
                                        "entry_id": "fda682f4-d800-31cf-8782-e2c3edf7e3d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The currency unit of Albania, divided into 100 qindarka."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b88b228a-b087-4e7e-b9bc-a509a44569ce",
                                                "sense_id": "16e14a75-0d7a-3122-931a-6b8db37ab514",
                                                "text": "With the loss of control by the Government over foreign exchange surrender requirements and the almost complete depletion of foreign exchange reserves, in early 1992 the official rate was further devalued to leks 50 = $1."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fedf4c60-7ff6-4d0a-a57f-8965bd7adb33",
                                                "sense_id": "16e14a75-0d7a-3122-931a-6b8db37ab514",
                                                "text": "1997, Igor Artimiev, Gary J. Fine, Country Studies: Albania, Ira W. Lieberman, Stilpon S. Nestor, Raj M. Desai, Between State and Market: Mass Privatization in Transition Economies, page 178,\nEnterprise shares are sold at voucher auctions in exchange for either immaterial privatization leks (through a bank transfer from the bidder's privatization lek account) or through privatization vouchers, which are submitted at the time of bidding."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29d9a6a1-c70d-499e-bb51-1558b8c26f13",
                                                "sense_id": "16e14a75-0d7a-3122-931a-6b8db37ab514",
                                                "text": "Value Added Tax is another tax imposed on all enterprises with a yearly turnover of more than 2 million Leks. VAT was introduced in the Albanian tax system in 1995 replacing the old turnover tax."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5f9b0310-78ca-4908-b6ac-454b0146053f",
                        "source_entry_id": "9b3352a2-6df5-31bd-b6d9-e30ca7df76b3",
